  "notes": "Research model; the model card says PaLM is designed for research. A Google post of 2023-03-14 (The next generation of AI for developers and Google Workspace) introduced the PaLM API in private preview for select developers with an efficient model, and said Google Cloud customers can access Google models including PaLM; it does not say that this was the 540B PaLM of the paper, so the lifecycle stays research-only. The PaLM-Coder fine-tunes in the paper are not recorded. The research post uses LaMDA only as a comparison, so no relation to google.lamda-1."
